   "h": "Causes by category",
   "html": "<p><b>Rule out</b> concurrent splenomegaly and jaundice</p><h4>Infiltrative — Malignant</h4><ul><li>Primary Carcinoma</li><li>Metastases</li><li>Lymphoma</li><li>Leukemia</li><li>Polycythemia</li><li>Multiple Myeloma</li></ul><h4>Infiltrative — Non-Malignant</h4><ul><li>Fatty Liver</li><li>Cysts</li><li>Hemochromatosis</li><li>Wilson’s Disease</li><li>Amyloidosis</li><li>Myelofibrosis</li></ul><h4>Congestive</h4><ul><li>Right Heart Failure</li><li>Budd-Chiari Syndrome</li><li>Constrictive Pericarditis</li></ul><h4>Infectious</h4><ul><li>Hepatitis A, B, C</li><li>Mononucleosis</li><li>Tuberculosis</li><li>Bacterial Cholangitis</li><li>Abscess</li><li>Schistosomiasis</li></ul><h4>Inflammatory</h4><ul><li>Alcoholic Hepatitis</li><li>Autoimmune Hepatitis</li><li>Drug Induced Hepatitis</li><li>Sarcoidosis</li><li>Histiocytosis X</li><li>Primary Sclerosing Cholangitis</li><li>Primary Biliary Cirrhosis</li></ul>"
  }
